    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>Instruction</name>
      <id>42</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Messaging with WhatsApp users is only available for business accounts. To set up the integration, follow these steps:
1. Conclude a contract with the WhatsApp Business API provider, Devino Telecom. Detailed instructions.
2. Obtain the &lt;b>Token&lt;/> and &lt;b>Channel Name&lt;/> from your Devino Telecom manager.
3. Click &lt;b>Activate&lt;/>. After successful activation, the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> field will be populated.
4. Provide the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> information to your Devino Telecom manager.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>ارسال و دریافت پیام با کاربران WhatsApp فقط برای حساب‌های تجاری در دسترس است. برای تنظیم یکپارچه‌سازی، مراحل زیر را انجام دهید:
1. با ارائه‌دهنده WhatsApp Business API، شرکت Devino Telecom، قرارداد منعقد کنید. دستورالعمل تفصیلی.
2. &lt;b>توکن&lt;/> و &lt;b>نام کانال&lt;/> را از مدیر Devino Telecom خود دریافت کنید.
3. روی &lt;b>فعال‌سازی&lt;/> کلیک کنید. پس از فعال‌سازی موفق، فیلد &lt;b>نقطه اتصال&lt;/> تکمیل خواهد شد.
4. اطلاعات &lt;b>نقطه اتصال&lt;/> را در اختیار مدیر Devino Telecom خود قرار دهید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Обмен сообщениями с пользователями WhatsApp возможен только для бизнес-аккаунта мессенджера. Для настройки необходимо:
1. Заключить договор с провайдером WhatsApp Business API - компанией &quot;Девино Телеком&quot;.
2. Получить у менеджера &quot;Девино Телеком&quot; &lt;b>К&lt;/>&lt;b>люч&lt;/> (token) и &lt;b>Имя канала&lt;/>.
3. Нажать &lt;b>Активизировать&lt;/>. После успешной активации поле &lt;b>Точка&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>подключения&lt;/> будет заполнено.
4. Сообщить менеджеру &quot;Девино Телеком&quot; &lt;b>Точку подключения&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>WhatsApp ile mesajlaşma, sadece iş yeri hesapları için mümkündür. Bunu ayarlayabilmek için yapılması gerekenler şunlardır:
1. WhatsApp Business API sağlayıcısı &quot;Devino Telecom&quot; ile bir sözleşme imzalayın.
2. &quot;Devino Telecom&quot; yöneticisinden &lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>Anahtar&lt;/> (token) ve &lt;b>Kanal adı&lt;/> alın.
3.&lt;b> Etkinleştir&lt;/> düğmesine basın. Aktivasyon başarılı olduktan sonra &lt;/>&lt;b>Bağlantı&lt;/> &lt;b>noktası&lt;/>&lt;b> alanı doldurulacaktır.
4. &quot;Devino Telecom&quot; &lt;b>Bağlantı noktası&lt;/> yöneticisini bilgilendirin.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Chỉ có thể nhắn tin với người dùng WhatsApp bằng tài khoản doanh nghiệp của ứng dụng nhắn tin. Để thiết lập, bạn cần:
1. Ký hợp đồng với nhà cung cấp WhatsApp Business API - công ty &quot;Devino Telecom&quot;.
2. Nhận từ người quản lý của &quot;Devino Telecom&quot; &lt;b>K&lt;/>&lt;b>hóa&lt;/> (token) và &lt;b>Tên kênh&lt;/>.
3. Nhấn &lt;b>Kích hoạt&lt;/>. Sau khi kích hoạt thành công, trường &lt;b>Điểm&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>kết nối&lt;/> sẽ được điền vào.
4. Thông báo cho người quản lý của &quot;Devino Telecom&quot; &lt;b>Điểm kết nối&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Messaging with WhatsApp users is only available for business accounts. To set up the integration, follow these steps:
1. Conclude a contract with the WhatsApp Business API provider, Devino Telecom. Detailed instructions.
2. Obtain the &lt;b>Token&lt;/> and &lt;b>Channel Name&lt;/> from your Devino Telecom manager.
3. Click &lt;b>Activate&lt;/>. After successful activation, the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> field will be populated.
4. Provide the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> information to your Devino Telecom manager.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Messaging with WhatsApp users is only available for business accounts. To set up the integration, follow these steps:
1. Conclude a contract with the WhatsApp Business API provider, Devino Telecom. Detailed instructions.
2. Obtain the &lt;b>Token&lt;/> and &lt;b>Channel Name&lt;/> from your Devino Telecom manager.
3. Click &lt;b>Activate&lt;/>. After successful activation, the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> field will be populated.
4. Provide the &lt;b>Connection Point&lt;/> information to your Devino Telecom manager.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
